# ELF section/dynamic fidelity lens config for fmt (8th survey lens,
# SURVEY_ELF_FIDELITY — pairs with SURVEY_SHARED=1 for the natural-config build).
# fmt defaults to a STATIC library (no BUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON), so "however cmake
# built it" is libfmt.a — compared section-set against the converted bazel
# cc_library libfmt.a (per-symbol -ffunction-sections collapsed to base names).
# Benign toolchain deltas auto-classified; residue (if any) lands in
# testdata/fidelity/fmt.elf-allowlist.txt.
ELFID_TARGET=fmt
ELFID_ARTIFACT=libfmt.a
